{"id":"vod_md_3726","vodId":"3726","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"漆黑的子弹","name_cn":"漆黑的子弹","date":"2014-01-01","year":"2014","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"13集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20230831-1/04523d41a18707a59b6c8af204a0907b.jpg"},"summary":"故事发生在遥远的二零二零年，在同神秘生物“原肠动物”的战争中，人类首次尝到了彻底失败的滋味，土地被剥夺，权利被压榨，在冷酷的独裁统治之下，人类被迫过起了苟且偷生的压抑生活。然而，即便如此，坚强的人们仍然没有放弃反抗的机会，为了对抗强大的敌人，“天童民间警备公司”成立了。表面看来，里见莲太郎（梶裕贵 配音）只是一介平凡的十六岁告众人，可实际上，他年纪轻轻就已经成为了“民警”中的一员，在搭档蓝原延珠（日高里菜 配音）的帮助下，莲太郎决定要找到莫名死亡的父母的真正死因。一个绝密任务的出现将莲太郎带往了巨大谜团的中心，在危险和杀戮之中，他最终会得到怎样的真相？","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-08-31 07:12:20","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230828/RxIxb7KG/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230828/j9Qp1tpw/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230828/YIJHFj60/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230828/CTXHqufO/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230828/LaqSrNZU/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230828/CIyPLZGU/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230828/hd02q2SV/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230828/q7cUb2DN/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230828/fKBhUAJA/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230828/G0JauXOt/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230828/ppRuZRsJ/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230828/2auPh2gg/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230828/SH5BJ6p5/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:33:47.533Z"}